{"id":"93f1683ca340f61b","group":"89","path":"89/89-cor-henkin-provable.md","title":"Henkin Sentence is Provable","display":"cor-henkin-provable — Henkin Sentence is Provable","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-cor-henkin-provable","aliases":["89-cor-henkin-provable"],"display":"cor-henkin-provable — Henkin Sentence is Provable","depends_on":["[[89-df-henkin-sentence-modal]]","[[89-df-lob-derivation]]","[[89-df-lob-axiom]]","[[89-df-gl-logic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-cor-henkin-provable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-cor-henkin-provable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-henkin-provable — Henkin Sentence is Provable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"728ff257684515d2\" href=\"?note=728ff257684515d2\" title=\"89-df-henkin-sentence-modal\">89-df-henkin-sentence-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b22854791214adbd\" href=\"?note=b22854791214adbd\" title=\"89-df-lob-derivation\">89-df-lob-derivation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"491579297d817026\" href=\"?note=491579297d817026\" title=\"89-df-lob-axiom\">89-df-lob-axiom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{H}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathcal{H}_{\\Box}\\)</span> is the class of GL fixed points of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box p\">\\(\\Box p\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}provable}\\vdash\n\\forall H\\in\\mathcal{H}_{\\Box}\\;(H\\in\\mathrm{GL}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}provable}\\vdash\n\\forall H\\in\\mathcal{H}_{\\Box}\\;(H\\in\\mathrm{GL}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> : Henkin句子 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"728ff257684515d2\" href=\"?note=728ff257684515d2\" title=\"89-df-henkin-sentence-modal\">89-df-henkin-sentence-modal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\">\\(\\Box\\)</span> : 模态算子</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\in\\mathcal H_\\Box\">\\(H\\in\\mathcal H_\\Box\\)</span> 给出的是 GL 中的可证等价\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\leftrightarrow\\Box H\">\\(H\\leftrightarrow\\Box H\\)</span>，不是语法等号。</li>\n<li>由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box H\\to H\">\\(\\Box H\\to H\\)</span>、必然化、Löb 公理及 MP 可导出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span>；这正是\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b22854791214adbd\" href=\"?note=b22854791214adbd\" title=\"89-df-lob-derivation\">89-df-lob-derivation</a> 所命名的 Löb 规则可容许性。</li>\n<li>与Gödel句子形成对比</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-henkin-sentence-modal","status":"resolved","id":"728ff257684515d2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-henkin-sentence-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-lob-derivation","status":"resolved","id":"b22854791214adbd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-lob-derivation]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-lob-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"491579297d817026","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-lob-axiom]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-henkin-sentence-modal","status":"resolved","id":"728ff257684515d2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$H$ : Henkin句子 (see [[89-df-henkin-sentence-modal]])","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-lob-derivation","status":"resolved","id":"b22854791214adbd","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"由 $\\Box H\\to H$、必然化、Löb 公理及 MP 可导出 $H$；这正是\n[[89-df-lob-derivation]] 所命名的 Löb 规则可容许性。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{H}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}provable}\\vdash\n\\forall H\\in\\mathcal{H}_{\\Box}\\;(H\\in\\mathrm{GL}).","display":true},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box","display":false},{"tex":"H\\in\\mathcal H_\\Box","display":false},{"tex":"H\\leftrightarrow\\Box H","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box H\\to H","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false}],"bytes":1038,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["728ff257684515d2","b22854791214adbd","491579297d817026","0006800fa1c85177"]}